3. ✅ **Verified Installation**: Confirmed `@vercel/speed-insights` package is present in package.json
4. ✅ **Verified Integration**: Confirmed SpeedInsights component is properly imported and rendered in app/layout.tsx
5. ✅ **Installed Dependencies**: Ran `pnpm install` to ensure all dependencies are up-to-date
